### HarakaPay API walkthrough
### Requires a running instance: docker compose up --build  (or ./mvnw spring-boot:run)
### @host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Register (creates the wallet too) — save the accessToken from the response
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "frankie@example.com",
  "fullName": "Frankie Ngaruiya",
  "password": "Sup3rSecret!x"
}

### 2. Login
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "frankie@example.com",
  "password": "Sup3rSecret!x"
}

### 3. Check the wallet (balance should be 0.00)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Simulate an M-Pesa-style deposit of KES 5,000.00 (500000 minor)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/me/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: deposit-0000000123456789
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountMinor": 500000,
  "narrative": "salary"
}

### 4b. Same key again -> exact same stored response, no second deposit
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/me/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: deposit-0000000123456789
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountMinor": 500000,
  "narrative": "salary"
}

### 4c. Same key, different payload -> 409 IDEMPOTENCY_CONFLICT
POST {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/me/topups
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: deposit-0000000123456789
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amountMinor": 999,
  "narrative": "sneaky"
}

### 5. Register a second user to transfer to (use their accountNumber)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "wanjiku@example.com",
  "fullName": "Wanjiku N",
  "password": "Sup3rSecret!x"
}

### 6. Transfer KES 2,000.00 to them
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-0000000123456789
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetAccountNumber": "HAR-000002",
  "amountMinor": 200000,
  "narrative": "lunch"
}

### 7. Inspect the two ledger legs (DEBIT + CREDIT)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/transfers/1/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Paged statement, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/me/statement?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Over the ceiling -> 422 INVALID_AMOUNT
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-0000000123456790
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetAccountNumber": "HAR-000002",
  "amountMinor": 50000001
}

### 10. More than the balance -> 422 INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS (still audited as a FAILED transfer)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: transfer-0000000123456791
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetAccountNumber": "HAR-000002",
  "amountMinor": 49900000
}

### 11. Missing token -> 401 problem document
GET {{host}}/api/v1/accounts/me

### 12. Reconciliation health check (ledgerIntegrity component)
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### 13. Prometheus metrics
GET {{host}}/actuator/prometheus
